<title>UNITED NATIONS: U.S. pays $150 million towards UN debt. [CORRECTED 20:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>U.S. pays $150 million towards UN debt. [CORRECTED 20:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States paid $150.7 million towards its United Nations peacekeeping debt on Wednesday, a U.N. spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The payment brought down to $1.5 billion (corrects from $2.4 billion) the debt that Washington owes the world body for current and past regular dues and peacekeeping ventures.</p>
</text>
